WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Step 1. Open Search patients, to find a registered patient.

1.2
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:10.532
In the facility sidebar, under Patient Management, select Search patients.

2.1
00:00:10.532 --> 00:00:13.106
Step 2. Search by an identifier.

2.2
00:00:13.106 --> 00:00:18.842
Select an identifier with the buttons below the search box, and type the value.

2.3
00:00:18.842 --> 00:00:21.448
Care shows up to 20 patients.

3.1
00:00:21.448 --> 00:00:23.800
Step 4. Read the results.

3.2
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:30.436
The table has the columns Patient Name, Phone Number, Gender and Actions.

4.1
00:00:30.436 --> 00:00:34.697
Step 5. Open the patient. Select the patient's row.

4.2
00:00:34.697 --> 00:00:40.202
In Verify Patient Identity, enter the year of birth and select Verify.

4.3
00:00:40.202 --> 00:00:44.004
If it is correct, Care opens Patient Home.
